'''The Womb''' is the fourth chapter of the game, unlocked after beating {{e|Mom}}. From the Womb onward, floors do not naturally generate item rooms or shops, and all damage taken will do a full heart of damage to Isaac's HP (unless he has {{i|The Wafer}}), regardless of the source. Like the {{s|Depths}} / {{s|Necropolis}} / {{s|Dank Depths}}, the Womb's second floor has a preset boss that will always be fought: {{e|Mom's Heart}} initially, and {{e|It Lives!}} after beating Mom's Heart 11 times.

The Womb has two alternate floors. The {{s|Utero}}, which, unlike alternate floors before it, does not need to be unlocked separately from the Womb and the {{s|Scarred Womb}}.

