== Notes ==
* It is possible to access the Womb before unlocking it by using {{p|Ehwaz}} or {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} on The Depths II.
* Using Ehwaz or We Need To Go Deeper on Womb / Utero II will lead the Isaac to {{s|Sheol}}, which will skip any of {{e|Mom's Heart}}'s [[ending]]s.
* Since shops no longer spawn in the Womb, it may be advisable to donate Isaac's remaining coins to the {{m|Donation Machine}} in the shop on {{s|Depths}} II.
* {{m|Beggar}}s still have a chance to spawn in {{r|Secret Room}}s or can be spawned with {{p|XX - Judgement}}, so some coins should still be saved for them.

