== Trivia ==
* The Womb being mentioned in [[Isaac's last will]] as a "warm place" is a reference to how the inner human body temperature is quite high.
* The Womb has a slight static filter covering the screen, possibly to represent heat.
** {{Dlc|nr}} The {{s|Utero}} shares this same static filter.
* In the original Binding of Isaac, {{e|Lokii}} and {{e|Teratoma}} were exclusive to the Utero.
** {{dlc|r}} Teratoma was moved back to the Utero.
* In flash Isaac, the Womb's backdrop had white ribs on the walls like in the The {{s|Utero}}, as both floors looked exactly the same in flash Isaac.

== Music ==
* The [[music]] for the Womb is titled ''Viscera''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>
** The term viscera represents the internal organs in the body.
** {{dlc|nr}} The {{s|Utero}} shares this same track.
* The music heard during the fight against Mom's Heart/It Lives! is called ''Ventricide''. Ventricide combines ventricle, a word that means a hollow area in an organ and is often associated with the heart, and the suffix -cide, which denotes the act of killing.

